@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #F6F8FC
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction
title SD-BE-11 目标代码模块和依赖
caption To-Be · Proposed · UC-01～08 · 模块间箭头只指向公开应用入口

package "Spring Boot 平台" {
  [入口与跨模块用例\nworkbench] as Workbench
  [交付归档\narchive] as Archive
  [运行\nruntime] as Runtime
  [配置目录\ncatalog] as Catalog
  [设备\ndevice] as Device
  [身份\nidentity] as Identity
  Workbench --> Identity : 激活与注销
  Workbench --> Catalog : 初始化个人项目
  Workbench --> Runtime : 释放会话占用 / 看板
  Workbench --> Archive : 归档视图
  Archive --> Runtime : 完成产物与运行锁
  Archive --> Device : 执行设备
  Archive --> Identity : 当前会话
  Runtime --> Catalog : 版本、当前权限、BRD 修订
  Runtime --> Device : 同机证明与认证
  Runtime --> Identity : 会话与授权账号
  Catalog --> Identity : 查找可授权账号
  Device --> Identity : 签发证明时校验会话
}

package "发起电脑" {
  [Java Worker] as Worker
}
Worker ..> Device : 配对与在线状态
Worker ..> Runtime : 任务领取与回报
Worker ..> Archive : 归档领取与回报
note right of Runtime
  launch · execution · collaboration
  gitprep · query
end note
legend bottom
实线表示平台内依赖，虚线表示 HTTP 运行调用。
各模块经自己的 JDBC 适配访问同一 PostgreSQL。
endlegend
@enduml
